From: canoziia <canoziia@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] glm5next: sm_80 thin-M BF16 GEMM for unquantized linears

VLLM_GLM5_THIN_GEMM (default 0 = unchanged), _MAX_TOKENS (32). Morrowmake's
split-K Triton GEMM behind a custom op for unquantized BF16 linears with
M <= 32 (target projections, shared experts, lm_head, drafter), plus the
kpool-gate call site and a pre-capture warmup. Not bitwise equal to cuBLAS
(summation order).

